∇ cells←Cells paste;t;i;j
 ⍝ The non-blank cells of the schedule part of paste, trimmed, in order.
  t←ToLF paste
  i←⊃⍸'Show Waitlisted Classes'⍷t
  j←⊃⍸'Printer Friendly Page'⍷t
  :If (0∊i j)∨j≤i
      'Cannot find the schedule (between "Show Waitlisted Classes" and "Printer Friendly Page")'⎕SIGNAL 11
  :EndIf
  t←(i+22)↓(j-1)↑t
  cells←(Trim¨(~t∊LF TAB)⊆t)~⊂''
∇
